00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:37.960
Sixteen.

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:39.320
Two more...

00:16:42.260 --> 00:16:44.360
Come any closer and you're dead!

00:16:47.300 --> 00:16:49.390
What's taking that idiot so long?

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:51.840
Maybe Billy's already onboard?

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:53.210
Hey, is Billy here?

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:53.370
Billy?
Hey, is Billy here?

00:16:53.370 --> 00:16:54.100
Billy?

00:16:54.610 --> 00:16:55.740
Billy is...

00:16:59.750 --> 00:17:00.510
Now!

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:05.020
What the?!

00:17:05.450 --> 00:17:06.750
Hang on tight.

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:18.430
Sorry.

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:18.870
No worries.
Sorry.

00:17:18.870 --> 00:17:19.330
No worries.

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:20.730
Hang on just a little longer!

00:17:24.070 --> 00:17:24.870
Here.

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:26.900
Are you okay?!

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:29.000
Did we get her?

00:17:31.080 --> 00:17:32.480
Oww...

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:35.720
How dare you shoot a lady in her behind?!

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:48.030
Billy is...

00:17:48.030 --> 00:17:49.260
That can't be!

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:55.930
Billy Galet...

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:07.350
So you're Billy?

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:12.610
Even in death, you've been transmitting
messages to Yuri all this time.

00:18:13.720 --> 00:18:18.030
I can't bear to keep making killing machines!

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:20.050
They're probably going to kill me soon anyway.

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:23.760
I'm sorry I couldn't keep our promise, Yuri.

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:32.870
It's no use. The portable
version can only carry one.

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:35.100
We're just going to have to
fight our way through the stairs.

00:18:51.660 --> 00:18:52.320
Kei!

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:54.830
Yuri, Billy's waiting for you
onboard the spaceship.

00:18:55.700 --> 00:18:58.290
I'll handle this here, so hurry up
and head to the spaceship.

00:18:58.530 --> 00:18:59.900
B-But...

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:01.630
The ship is going to take off in two minutes.

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:04.560
Getting this guy onboard is your job, right?

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:05.800
There.

00:19:07.740 --> 00:19:09.880
Come on, hurry! Help him or he'll fall!

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:10.640
Got it!

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:14.210
Some things are better left unknown.

00:19:20.890 --> 00:19:21.680
Yuri!

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:30.160
I'll finally see Billy!

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:31.270
The countdown has already started!

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:32.100
Fifty-one...
The countdown has already started!

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:32.330
Fifty-one...

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:33.300
Fifty...

