Forty-nine...

00:19:33.430 --> 00:19:34.400
Thanks.
Forty-nine...

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:35.570
Forty-eight...

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:36.700
Forty-seven...

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:37.870
Forty-six...

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:39.070
Forty-five...

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:40.140
Forty-four...

00:19:40.140 --> 00:19:40.310
Forty-three...

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:41.210
Kei!
Forty-three...

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:41.440
Forty-three...

00:19:41.440 --> 00:19:42.610
Forty-two...

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:43.600
Forty-one...

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:00.430
Why you!

00:20:08.300 --> 00:20:10.670
Oh great, looks like my ride left.

00:20:11.340 --> 00:20:12.500
Ah! Yuri?!

00:20:13.110 --> 00:20:14.080
Long time no see.

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:14.240
What are you doing?
Long time no see.

00:20:14.240 --> 00:20:15.710
What are you doing?

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:17.270
Can't you tell?

00:20:17.910 --> 00:20:19.440
Why'd you come back?

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:22.950
You're so dumb.

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:26.010
Well, I couldn't leave a klutz like you behind.

00:20:26.550 --> 00:20:27.890
Yep, really dumb.

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:28.090
Yeah. Dumb enough to come
back for my stupid partner.
Yep, really dumb.

00:20:28.090 --> 00:20:31.120
Yeah. Dumb enough to come
back for my stupid partner.

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:32.560
Yuri...

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:32.830
Eh?
Yuri...

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:33.430
Eh?

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:36.430
I had a little chat with Billy.

00:20:36.430 --> 00:20:37.620
Really?

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:45.440
He said it's going to be a while
until he finishes the real Lucia.

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:48.470
I see.

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:52.410
Maybe not seeing him
was a good thing, after all.

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:54.820
I can always be with Billy in my memories.

00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:56.110
He also told me...

00:20:56.950 --> 00:20:59.320
...that he still loves you.

00:21:00.890 --> 00:21:02.450
Well, how could he not!

00:21:03.220 --> 00:21:05.330
Here they come, Yuri.
The real battle starts now!

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:08.260
I know. After all, we still have
a million-credit mission to complete!

00:21:08.260 --> 00:21:09.700
Ah, that's not happening.

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:11.700
Huh?

00:21:11.900 --> 00:21:14.270
I'm the one who called in the job.

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:15.930
What did you say?!

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.170
There is no one million credits.

00:21:18.170 --> 00:21:19.610
Wait, does that mean?!

00:21:23.810 --> 00:21:25.680
What about the 100,000 credit down payment?

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:29.520
Where do you think it came from?
From our joint account!

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:31.290
H-How dare you!

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:33.910
Quit complaining and shoot!
You want to die?

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:39.290
You should be thanking me, you know.

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:42.230
After you spent our savings
without my knowledge?

00:21:47.940 --> 00:21:48.990
Why you!

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:53.110
I did it for you!

00:21:53.110 --> 00:21:54.600
I know, but still!

00:21:59.350 --> 00:22:01.550
Let's settle this after we finish the job!

00:22:01.550 --> 00:22:02.910
All right, partner!

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:10.830
You ready?!

00:22:10.830 --> 00:22:11.880
Yeah!

